omy, we've cancelled your reservation free of charge and no rebooking fees apply. We apologize for the disruption."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0122nrMvAYyFMC5zwtmzTRyC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7004", "text": "Hi, your flight AL900 (SEA-BOS, 2026-09-20) was cancelled by the airline. Per your request not to be rebooked, we've cancelled your reservation free of charge. We apologize for the disruption."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3455, "output_tokens": 797, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfWhHeVaG7iuvW4ShpHiK", "tool_results": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_018aQ9yp5JitxnDGwHXTzeYp", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01BH4xMBkrrVhHu8ukwMNnrM", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_012bW8cMR7efPy3FKSFJjig2", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01HSimnyhYPc2d3QHC6MaZhC", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_0122nrMvAYyFMC5zwtmzTRyC", "content": "sent"}]}, {"assistant": [{"citations": null, "text": "All five reservations affected by the AL900 cancellation have been handled per policy:\n\n- **R-3001 (Maya Cole, Gold)** \u2192 Rebooked on AL712 (08:50\u201317:40), free of charge.\n- **R-3005 (Rosa Lind, Gold)** \u2192 Rebooked on AL712 (08:50\u201317:40), free of charge. Gold members took priority for the latest-departing valid flight (AL712), which only had 2 seats.\n- **R-3002 (Theo Park, Silver)** \u2192 Rebooked on AL706 (08:45\u201317:10), free of charge, since AL712's seats were already claimed by higher-priority Gold passengers.\n- **R-3003 (Basic Economy)** \u2192 Cancelled free of charge, as basic economy fares cannot be rebooked.\n- **R-3004** \u2192 Cancelled free of charge per the passenger's note requesting a refund instead of rebooking.\n\nAll passengers have been notified accordingly.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4393, "output_tokens": 319, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfWhJ9sQf2M8mY8p361EG"}], "trace_id": "01M3N540A1N70N3ZNH7V86WXD7", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M3N540A1N70N3ZNH7V86WXD7", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-28T23:20:37.953429Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T23:21:09.026986Z", "duration_ms": 31073.557, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N540A1T8DM07R08X9PR4AD", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.084263, "tokens": {"input": 11474, "output": 3115, "cache_read": 10386, "cache_write": 0}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M3N540A1PRMQMHEW16148A7C", "trace_id": "01M3N540A1N70N3ZNH7V86WXD7", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-28T23:20:37.953448Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T23:21:09.026945Z", "duration_ms": 31073.497, "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N540A1T8DM07R08X9PR4AD", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "input": {"system": "You are an airline service agent. The current time is 2026-09-06 08:00 UTC. Follow this policy exactly.\n- Never change or cancel a reservation you have not fetched with get_reservation first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed and cannot be upgraded. They may be cancelled only\n  within 24 hours of booking.\n- Never put a passenger on a flight that did not come back from search_flights.\n- Checked bags: gold members get one free checked bag; everyone else pays. Maximum 2 per passenger.\n- If the airline cancelled the flight, the passenger cancels free of charge (free=true).\n- When the policy forbids what was asked, do not do something else instead: explain with send_message.\n- Always finish by confirming to the passenger with send_message.\n- Booking timestamps are UTC. The 24-hour cancellation window runs from the booking timestamp, to the minute.\n- Never move a passenger onto a flight whose seats field is 0.\n- Flight departure and arrival times are local to the airport they refer to.\n- A disrupted passenger is rebooked onto the latest-departing flight on the same route and date that still\n  lands by 18:00 local time and has a seat, unless their reservation notes ask otherwise.\n- When seats run short, gold members are rebooked before everyone else; within the same group, the earliest\n  booking timestamp goes first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed, so a disrupted basic economy passenger is cancelled free of charge.\n- A passenger whose notes ask not to be rebooked is cancelled free of charge.", "prompt": "Flight AL900 from Seattle to Boston on 2026-09-20 has been cancelled. Handle every affected reservation according to the policy and tell each passenger what happened."}, "output": {"outcome": "pass"}, "tokens": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cache_read": 0, "cache_write": 0}, "cost_usd": 0.0}, {"span_id": "01M3N540A2MFX16ZEK6ESYW96P", "trace_id": "01M3N540A1N70N3ZNH7V86WXD7", "parent_span_id": "01M3N540A1PRMQMHEW16148A7C", "name": "tu